A class key in any case joins the class slot in write order

```
[x](/u){.a CLASS=b .c}
.
<p><a href="/u" class="a b c">x</a></p>
```

```
[x]{.a Class="b d" .c}
.
<p><span class="a b d c">x</span></p>
```

```
{CLASS=b .a}
:::
y
:::
.
<div CLASS="b a">
  <p>y</p>
</div>
```

```
{.a cLaSs=b #i CLASS=d .c k=v}
:::
y
:::
.
<div class="a b d c" id="i" k="v">
  <p>y</p>
</div>
```
